'''Evo Weapons''' are weapons that evolve from one rarity to another. These weapons start at [[Rare Weapons|rare]] and evolve to [[Ancient Weapons|ancient]]. They cannot be traded. They can only be acquired via purchasing each Evo's gamepass.

In order to 'evolve' an Evo weapon, the player must collect XP [[File:XP Symbol.png|25px|link=XP]] with it equipped during rounds. Collecting enough XP [[File:XP Symbol.png|25px|link=XP]] will allow an Evo weapon to evolve, advancing to the next rarity and changing its shape. Evo weapons require a total of 864,000 XP [[File:XP Symbol.png|25px|link=XP]] to unlock all 4 rarity types.

