==Trivia==
* They were first introduced during the [[Halloween Event 2021]].
*"Evo" is short for "Evolution", hence how you "evolve" your knives.
*Players are able to equip any of the 4 rarities once their evo fully evolved.
*[[Reaver]] was the first Evo to be released in the game.
*Using your Evo after reaching the ancient tier will still count the XP progress bar past the limit.
*Players that own at least 1 Evo will gain the "Trophies" section on their player card in game, despite nothing showing up there otherwise. This is likely due to Evos, Nerf Promos and Trophies using the same untradable status in the game's code.
*There are currently no Evo guns.

